===Instanced bosses===
As opposed to world bosses, instanced bosses are fought in their own arena. They are generally fought alone, with the exceptions of [[The Nightmare]], which is a group instanced boss, and the [[Royal Titans]] and [[Yama]], which are duo instanced bosses. Spawning instanced bosses either requires an action ([[Zulrah]], [[Vorkath]], and [[Yama]]), while others simply spawn upon entering the instance ([[Brutus]], [[Obor]], [[Bryophyta]], [[Amoxliatl]], [[Royal Titans]], [[Phantom Muspah]], [[Doom of Mokhaiotl]], and both forms of the Nightmare).

